    "body": "Review notes fixed in d7085f50:\n\n1. **Load other / Edit click-tested** - new `load_other_and_edit_queue_their_own_dialogs` (`tests/machine_page.rs`, undrained harness so no rfd modal opens): clicking Load other queues only `LoadMachineDialog`, clicking Edit queues only `EditMachineDialog`.\n2. **No extra separator without setups** - `setup_pages.rs` Post page draws the separator after the ownership block only when `ctx.is_some()`; the no-setups Post page matches upstream main again. Pinned by `the_post_page_without_setups_has_no_extra_separator` (the hint and the \"Post\" row sit one item spacing apart).\n\nMutations (each red, restored, green):\n- Edit queues `LoadMachineDialog` -> click test FAILED\n- Load other / Edit swapped -> click test FAILED\n- guard removed (`if true`) -> separator test FAILED\n\nGate: camcraft-ui lib single-threaded from `crates/ui`: 682 passed, 0 failed, 5 ignored. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean. No snapshot PNGs.\n\nReady for a re-check.\n",
